---

## 1️⃣ Fairmont San Francisco  
**Address:** 950 Mason St, San Francisco, CA 94108, United States  
**Distance to Golden Gate Bridge:** ~2.2 mi (≈ 35‑minute drive, 10‑minute rideshare)  

### Why it’s a good fit
| Feature | Details |
|---------|---------|
| **Gym / Fitness centre** | 24‑hour **Fitness Center** on the 5th floor – cardio machines, free‑weights, yoga studio, and a small group‑class space. |
| **Conference / Meeting space** | 4 dedicated meeting rooms (total ≈ 5,200 sq ft) with AV, high‑speed Wi‑Fi, and on‑site catering.  Club‑level rooms give access to a private lounge with complimentary breakfast and evening hors‑d’oeuvres. |
| **Business amenities** | Business centre (printing, fax, workstations), high‑speed Wi‑Fi throughout the property, multiple on‑site dining venues, and a rooftop bar with panoramic city views – great for networking receptions. |
| **Room types (relevant for a 10‑night stay)** | Deluxe King, Executive Suite, Club Level (includes lounge access). All rooms have a work‑desk, ergonomic chair, and in‑room safe. |
| **Cancellation policy** | Free cancellation up to 48 h before check‑in; after that the first night’s rate is charged. |
| **Recent guest rating** | 4.6 / 5 (≈ 2,300+ reviews on major travel sites). |
| **Accessibility** | ADA‑compliant rooms, wheelchair‑accessible public areas, braille signage. |
| **Typical payment methods accepted** | • **Credit cards** – Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover  <br>• **PayPal**  <br>• **Apple Pay / Google Pay**  <br>• **Airline‑gift‑cards** (e.g., United, Delta)  <br>• **Direct corporate invoicing** (net‑30) for group bookings  <br>• **Pre‑authorization hold** of ~USD 150 at check‑in for incidentals. |

---

## 2️⃣ Hotel Zephyr (Fisherman’s Wharf)  
**Address:** 250 Beach St, San Francisco, CA 94133, United States  
**Distance to Golden Gate Bridge:** ~1.8 mi (≈ 30‑minute drive, 8‑minute rideshare)  

### Why it’s a good fit
| Feature | Details |
|---------|---------|
| **Gym / Fitness centre** | 24‑hour **Fitness Center** on the 2nd floor – treadmills, ellipticals, free‑weights, and a small circuit‑training area. |
| **Conference / Meeting space** | Large event space (≈ 2,800 sq ft) on the 2nd floor that can be split into two rooms; equipped with projector, sound system, and high‑speed Wi‑Fi. |
| **Business amenities** | Complimentary high‑speed Wi‑Fi throughout, on‑site business centre (printing & fax), on‑site restaurant “The Wharf” and rooftop bar “The Deck” for informal networking. |
| **Room types (relevant for a 10‑night stay)** | Standard King, Deluxe King with harbor view, Family Suite (2‑bedroom). All rooms include a work‑desk, ergonomic chair, and in‑room safe. |
| **Cancellation policy** | Free cancellation up to 24 h before arrival; after that, 1‑night rate is charged. |
| **Recent guest rating** | 4.4 / 5 (≈ 1,800+ reviews). |
| **Accessibility** | ADA‑compliant rooms, elevators, wheelchair‑accessible public spaces. |
| **Typical payment methods accepted** | • **Credit cards** – Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover  <br>• **PayPal**  <br>• **Apple Pay / Google Pay**  <br>• **Travel‑voucher codes** (Expedia, Booking.com, etc.)  <br>• **Corporate invoicing** (net‑30) for groups of 10 + rooms  <br>• **Pre‑authorization hold** of ~USD 200 at check‑in for incidentals. |

---

## How to Move Forward

1. **Reserve a Block** – Contact each hotel’s sales/meetings team (phone or email) and request a **block reservation** for **Nov 20 – Nov 30 2024**.  Provide the expected number of rooms (e.g., 30‑40 rooms per hotel) and any corporate discount codes you have.  
2. **Confirm Gym Access** – Both properties include gym access for all registered guests; ask for a “fitness‑center pass” that can be printed on the conference badge for easy entry.  
3. **Set Up Payment** – For a corporate conference you can:
   * Use a corporate credit‑card (most hotels accept Visa/MasterCard/Amex).  
   * Request a **direct‑billing invoice** (net‑30) – the hotel will issue a single invoice after the stay, which is convenient for large groups.  
   * If you prefer a prepaid option, you can pre‑pay the block via **PayPal** or **Apple Pay** and the hotel will hold the rooms without a credit‑card pre‑authorization.  

